    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "For a murder cleaner, blood is anything but silent.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn this puzzle adventure, you are Asset 1080, the legendary 'cleaner' tasked with concealing all evidence of government-sanctioned assassinations\u2014including your presence at the scene.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe year is 2010. The intelligence agency is cracking down on a wave of criminal activity funded by cryptocurrency technology. Follow the money and dismantle the network, bit by bit.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures<br />\r\n\u2022 14 all-new missions set in locations around the globe, each with a unique disposal method (some with multiple!)<br />\r\n\u2022 Each target is a puzzle: Seek out anything\u2014and anyone\u2014that will help you cover up the agency's actions.<br />\r\n\u2022 Countless ways to fail: Even the best cleaners mess up a time or two, sometimes spectacularly.<br />\r\n\u2022 Hand-crafted art: Explore over 100 hand-drawn scenes.<br />\r\n\u2022 The legend grows: Continue Asset 1080's story, building on the events of Nobodies: Murder Cleaner and After Death.<br />\r\n\u2022 Hidden collectibles: Find special items in select missions across all three games of the Nobodies trilogy!",
    "about_the_game": "For a murder cleaner, blood is anything but silent.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn this puzzle adventure, you are Asset 1080, the legendary 'cleaner' tasked with concealing all evidence of government-sanctioned assassinations\u2014including your presence at the scene.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe year is 2010. The intelligence agency is cracking down on a wave of criminal activity funded by cryptocurrency technology. Follow the money and dismantle the network, bit by bit.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures<br />\r\n\u2022 14 all-new missions set in locations around the globe, each with a unique disposal method (some with multiple!)<br />\r\n\u2022 Each target is a puzzle: Seek out anything\u2014and anyone\u2014that will help you cover up the agency's actions.<br />\r\n\u2022 Countless ways to fail: Even the best cleaners mess up a time or two, sometimes spectacularly.<br />\r\n\u2022 Hand-crafted art: Explore over 100 hand-drawn scenes.<br />\r\n\u2022 The legend grows: Continue Asset 1080's story, building on the events of Nobodies: Murder Cleaner and After Death.<br />\r\n\u2022 Hidden collectibles: Find special items in select missions across all three games of the Nobodies trilogy!",
    "short_description": "Step back into the shoes of Asset 1080, the intelligence agency's top cleaner. Puzzle your way through 14 unique locations, devising clever ways to hide all evidence of your employer's deadly actions. Get in, get out, and leave no bodies behind.",
